    "claim": "Dasatinib is a second-generation tyrosine kinase inhibitor used to treat chronic myeloid leukemia (CML).",
    "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
    "rationale": "The first PubMed title and abstract explicitly state: 'Dasatinib, a second-generation tyrosine kinase inhibitor used for treating chronic myeloid leukaemia (CML)'."
  },
  {
    "claim": "Dasatinib treats CML by targeting SRC kinases.",
    "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
    "rationale": "The second PubMed abstract states that dasatinib 'targets Bcr/Abl and SRC kinases', and the first abstract links pulmonary arterial hypertension to 'Src kinase inhibition'."
  },
